---
import EpilineCaseLayout from '../../../layouts/EpilineCaseLayout.astro';
const queries=[['endosfera riga','1.5'],['lāzerepilācija vīriešiem','2.3'],['laser hair removal riga','3.1'],['endosfēra','4.8'],['vakuuma masāža','5.2'],['lāzerepilācija','6.1'],['лазерная эпиляция рига','6.4']];
---
<EpilineCaseLayout title="Epiline SEO case" description="How Epiline builds non-branded organic treatment demand in Latvian and Russian search." eyebrow="SEO / ORGANIC ACQUISITION" headline="Search visibility" accent="that compounds." intro="The objective was never to rank only for the Epiline name. We built organic visibility around the treatments people search for before they know which clinic to choose." metrics={[{value:'TOP 10',label:'high-intent non-branded searches'},{value:'275',label:'organic enquiries · Jan–Aug 2026'},{value:'2,150+',label:'non-branded clicks tracked in KPI reporting'},{value:'2 lang.',label:'Latvian + Russian'}]}>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">THE STRATEGY</span><div><h2>Own the question<br/>before the booking.</h2><p class="statement">Service pages capture demand. Useful content creates more ways to be discovered.</p><p>Epiline’s SEO structure combines commercial treatment pages with informational content around comparisons, reviews, preparation and common questions. It works across Latvian and Russian, reflecting how people actually search in Riga and Jurmala.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section accent"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">GOOGLE SEARCH CONSOLE · JAN–AUG 2026</span><h2>Real queries.<br/>Real positions.</h2><div class="data-list">{queries.map(([q,p])=><div class="data-row"><span>{q}</span><span>non-branded search</span><strong>AVG. #{p}</strong></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">CONTENT AS ACQUISITION</span><div><h2>Not a blog<br/>for the sake of a blog.</h2><div class="data-list"><div class="data-row"><span>Endospheres FAQ</span><span>Jan–Aug 2026</span><strong>310 clicks</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Vacuum massage guide</span><span>Jan–Aug 2026</span><strong>282 clicks</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Endospheres reviews</span><span>Jan–Aug 2026</span><strong>211 clicks</strong></div></div><p>These pages meet potential patients while they are researching a procedure, not only when they already know the Epiline brand.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section dark"><div class="shell two"><span class="eyebrow">THE OUTCOME</span><div><h2>Demand that remains<br/>when ads stop.</h2><p class="statement">Organic search generated enquiries every month in the 2026 reporting period.</p><p>SEO gives the acquisition system a layer that does not require paying for every individual click — and reduces dependence on any single paid channel.</p></div></div></section>
</EpilineCaseLayout>